  "solution": "$a^2+b^2+4c^2+2ab+4bc+4ca$\n$=a^2+b^2+(2c)^2+2ab+2\\cdot b\\cdot2c+2\\cdot2c\\cdot a$\n$=(a+b+2c)^2$",
