  "answer": "$(x-y+z)^2$",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$x^2+y^2+z^2-2xy-2yz+2zx$\n$=x^2+(-y)^2+z^2+2\\cdot x\\cdot(-y)+2\\cdot(-y)\\cdot z+2zx$\n$=(x-y+z)^2$",
  "parent": ""
 },
 {
