  "answer": "$(x+3)^3$",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$x^3+9x^2+27x+27=x^3+3\\cdot x^2\\cdot3+3\\cdot x\\cdot3^2+3^3$\n$=(x+3)^3$",
  "parent": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "SSEN-공수1-0146",
